1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,800
Zhijiang Rongliang Wuxian Tech (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd. / Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Tech Co., Ltd.

2
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,440
Stop.

3
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,960
What's wrong, Lord Su?

4
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,440
Under the law of the Great Tang,

5
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,900
is playing the qin a crime?

6
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,600
I came here

7
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:26,800
just to see

8
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,320
this famous qin academy.

9
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,039
I heard this is Master Han's life's work.

10
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,600
Now it seems

11
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,500
it's nothing special.

12
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:35,440
Shut up!

13
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:36,800
Say it again.

14
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,800
It's the same even if I say it a hundred times.

15
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,800
Your Shuxiang Qin Academy is trash.

16
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,160
If you have the skills,

17
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,320
then get on the stage

18
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,650
and compete with me in playing the qin.

19
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,090
This is too much.

20
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,690
Send the body to the morgue.

21
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,680
I need to perform an autopsy.

22
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:02,440
But it hasn't been seven days since Master passed.

23
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,240
Put it here.

24
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,500
Aren't you scared?

25
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,440
What are you doing?

26
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,840
Stop pretending.

27
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,840
Before the old man died,

28
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,760
did he give you "Nanshan Youtai"?

29
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,600
No, he didn't.

30
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:39,160
You're secretly keeping "Nanshan Youtai".

31
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,200
It's a priceless music score.

32
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,480
You are mistaken, senior brother.

33
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:45,280
I don't understand music scores at all.

34
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,760
Why would I hide them?

35
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,400
Still acting in front of me, huh?

36
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,120
Where did you hide it?

37
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,280
I really don't know.

38
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,440
Nanshan Youtai

39
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:59,680
is the essence of our master's lifelong learning.

40
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,080
He kept saying

41
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,600
he would pass the score to one of us,

42
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:06,320
but he never specified who.

43
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,180
I've always known that

44
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,440
in his heart,

45
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:12,280
only one disciple is worthy of Nanshan Youtai,

46
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:14,000
and that's me.

47
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,579
Tell me where it is hidden.

48
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,560
Xiao.

49
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,400
Master was clearly killed by that

50
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,320
Western Regions demon.

51
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,920
And he even came here today

52
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,600
to humiliate us like this.

53
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,610
I am the eldest senior brother.

54
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,380
My zither skills are the best.

55
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:34,160
If I can get the score,

56
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:35,560
I can get revenge.

57
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,600
Xiaoxiao.

58
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,840
The old man is dead,

59
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,160
and now I have Nanshan Youtai.

60
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,560
From now on,

61
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,880
I am the number one musician in the world.

62
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,280
Then...

63
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,200
w-what about

64
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,000
the other two senior brothers?

65
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
If you dare tell anyone,

66
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:15,160
I'll tear you to pieces.

67
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,970
There won't be any more reanimations.

68
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:45,840
No poisoning.

69
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:47,400
No wounds.

70
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:50,940
Suddenly bleeding from all orifices and dying.

71
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,760
This is too bizarre.

72
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,280
Could it be

73
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,720
that this zither music really has magic

74
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,640
and can kill?

75
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,880
The Human Bone Wolf Head Zither.

76
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,610
Such a sinister instrument

77
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,280
shouldn't exist in this world.

78
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:06,520
I've never seen such an evil thing.

79
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,890
Oh no, Cui Yujing went to the arena.

80
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,200
Go.

81
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,840
Okay.

82
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:24,200
This Western Region demon is doing evil,

83
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,850
pushing people too far!

84
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,400
I, Cui Yujing,

85
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,960
will enforce justice on behalf of Heaven today

86
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,080
and for my master,

87
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,640
take revenge!

88
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:36,400
Good!

89
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,930
Competing with me in zither

90
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,640
will cost you your life.

91
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:42,960
Do you dare?

92
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,400
Although I don't know

93
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:47,520
what tricks you used to make my master die suddenly,

94
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,520
today

95
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,960
you will definitely be defeated by me.

96
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,090
One stick of incense

97
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,520
decides life and death.

98
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,200
Your time of death has come.

99
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,410
It's 'Nan Shan You Tai'.

100
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,440
Ashina Xiao is dead for sure.

101
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,840
I think this side will definitely lose.

102
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:16,760
Excuse me.

103
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:18,890
Senior brother is indeed amazing.

104
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,160
Teach that Western Region man a good lesson.

105
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,400
'Nan Shan You Tai'.

106
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,060
What is 'Nan Shan You Tai'?

107
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,960
This 'Nan Shan You Tai' is a masterpiece.

108
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:31,610
It is said that this sheet music has been lost for a long time.

109
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,400
It's indeed 'Nan Shan You Tai' left by Musician Han.

110
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,760
To hear this piece,

111
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,200
I would die without regrets.

112
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,400
Yes, yes.

113
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,620
Cui Yujing's music has such great momentum.

114
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,840
He's bound to win.

115
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,200
Teach that Western Region man a good lesson.

116
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,200
Not necessarily.

117
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:12,960
What?

118
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,860
Look at Cui Yujing's face.

119
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,200
Good!

120
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,080
He's lost his mind.

121
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,160
I won.

122
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,840
I won!

123
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,080
I am the best in the world!

124
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:45,840
Stop quickly!

125
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,600
Someone died.

126
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,040
Is Cui Yujing dead?

127
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,610
This Western Region demon.

128
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,080
This Western Region demon.

129
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,210
Did he kill someone?

130
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,520
Stop.

131
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:10,960
Stop right there.

132
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,280
Daring to kill in the street.

133
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,280
I will arrest you.

134
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,180
I was just playing the zither.

135
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,650
How is that killing?

136
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:22,280
Are your Tang Dynasty laws so trifling,

137
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,840
or are you deliberately oppressing me, a foreigner?

138
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:25,280
You!

139
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,530
Who exactly are you?

140
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:31,280
I am a soul

141
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,480
that shouldn't exist in this world.

142
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,640
Who else? Who else?

143
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,890
I am waiting for you.

144
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,900
I think it was Ashina Xiao who killed him.

145
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,880
He did it to avenge Chu Feng.

146
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,640
The motive is very clear.

147
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:09,160
But we can't arrest him

148
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,400
based on the absurd claim

149
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,930
that zither music can kill.

150
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,640
Are you listening to me?

151
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,240
Can you be quiet for a moment?

152
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,620
Don't you think my playing

153
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:22,520
is a little different from Cui Yujing's?

154
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,180
Can you say something useful?

155
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,810
What's the difference?

156
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,360
It's obvious you don't understand zither music.

157
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,240
The one I have

158
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:31,300
is the real 'Nanshan Youtai'.

159
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,570
The real 'Nanshan Youtai'?

160
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,810
Where did you get it?

161
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,560
It's from my collection.

162
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,880
I'm a distinguished guest of Prince Ling.

163
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,680
I bought it for 200 taels of gold.

164
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,400
If my guess is right,

165
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,760
Cui Yujing's copy of 'Nanshan Youtai'

166
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:52,520
is fake.

167
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,280
He mixed

168
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,760
the evil Western Regions melody,

169
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:58,000
'Chonggu Yao', into it.

170
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,520
'Chonggu Yao'?

171
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,560
Legend has it that 'Chonggu Yao'

172
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,880
can trigger the Gu insects in the body

173
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:04,920
and kill.

174
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,520
This perfectly aligns with the idea

175
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,320
of zither music killing people.

176
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,240
Stop crying.

177
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,490
Everyone, come and take a look.

178
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:27,040
This is the famous yellow wine of Fangzhou.

179
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:45,240
This is the Jiuyin Gu from the Western Regions.

180
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,160
Put the eggs

181
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:47,640
into tea or wine,

182
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,560
and let someone consume them.

183
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,040
It takes two to three months at the fastest,

184
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,160
or two to three years at the slowest.

185
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,520
When the Gu matures,

186
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,400
it devours the internal organs.

187
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,600
This is the Jiuyin Gu.

188
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,880
Because of the unique brewing process of yellow wine,

189
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:03,120
it has a strong reaction to the Gu.

190
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:06,400
Driven by the evil melody 'Chonggu Yao',

191
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:08,640
this bug will backfire on its host,

192
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,400
causing them

193
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:11,520
to bleed from the seven orifices and die.

194
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,160
It must be that person from the Western Regions.

195
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:15,480
Lord Su, please arrest him quickly.

196
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,520
The murderer

197
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:18,440
might not be Ashina Xiao.

198
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,920
Because this melody

199
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:22,120
was played by the victim himself.

200
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,480
The evil melody of 'Chonggu Yao' was mixed

201
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,880
into his sheet music for 'Nanshan Youtai'.

202
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,120
Musician Han

203
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:29,360
and Cui Yujing

204
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,340
both died because of this.

205
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:35,240
I also checked the entry and exit records of Fangzhou for the past three months.

206
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,440
Ashina Xiao only arrived five days ago.

207
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,360
He had no time to poison them at all.

208
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,480
Then who is the murderer?

209
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,210
The poisoner

210
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,880
might not be Ashina Xiao.

211
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,240
But Master and Senior Brother

212
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,880
both died competing with him in playing the zither.

213
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,410
He is definitely involved.

214
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:48,300
Therefore,

215
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,900
Ashina Xiao must have an accomplice behind him.

216
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,640
This person

217
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,120
must not only have the ability

218
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,880
but also the time to enter and exit the Zither Academy freely

219
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,410
to complete the poisoning.

220
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,880
This means that

221
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,240
everyone present here

222
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,120
is a suspect.
